657","title":"贺圣朝","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"草堂初寐，青衣扃户，丹项归巢。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:658","title":"贺新郎 题西湖官驿水阁","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"倩来鸾传语，问陆家、兄弟翩翩，今归何处。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:659","title":"浪淘沙令","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"一个主人翁。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:660","title":"浪淘沙令","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"修竹间青松。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:661","title":"烛影摇红","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"金菊初开，玉蟾新满升天皎。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:662","title":"粉蝶儿","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"欲识还丹，认取自家宗祖。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:663","title":"绣薄眉","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"化愚鲁。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:664","title":"莺啼序","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"三峰路险，雪满空崖，瑞祥烟雾起。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:665","title":"逍遥乐","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"天边月，初似弓。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:666","title":"减字木兰花","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"并州霜早。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:667","title":"探春令","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"草堂三鼓梦游仙，到蓬壶阆苑。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:668","title":"望梅花","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"日向南窗犹睡。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:669","title":"望梅花","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"死生于身最大。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:670","title":"望梅花","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"百岁韶华如电。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:671","title":"望梅花","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"莫见他人长短。","body":{"start":671,"hash":"6af9110c88d320f1e055d1744206c69aa6aa0007b064541003a152c326fd37f5"}},{"id":"yuan-era:672","title":"望梅花","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"是是非非休辩。","body":31},{"id":"yuan-era:673","title":"望梅花","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"密密彤云覆地。","body":31},{"id":"yuan-era:674"